Package: discourse-libvips42
Architecture: any
Depends: discourse-libjpegli62 (>= 0.12.0~git20260601.031a007), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: reduced libvips runtime for Discourse
 A hardened libvips build containing only the raster, HEIF, SVG, text, and
 metadata operations required by Discourse. ImageMagick modules are disabled.

Package: discourse-vips-tools
Section: graphics
Architecture: any
Depends: discourse-libvips42 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: command-line tools for Discourse's reduced libvips
 The vips, vipsheader, vipsedit, and vipsthumbnail command-line programs.
